imestampSeconds":1,"timestampLabel":"0:01","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- meeting to order, please stand for the Pledge of Allegiance. I pledge allegiance to the flag of the United States of America, and to the republic for which it stands, one nation under God, indivisible, with liberty and justice for all. Thank you all very much. Please be seated. Welcome to the August","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14860-tx-1025-37","meetingDate":"2025-08-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 8/19/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14860","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14860","timestampSeconds":1025,"timestampLabel":"17:05","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- what a chaotic mess that is. But the choir room floor is in at this point. I'm sorry, the band room floor is in at this point. And I wanted an updated shot of that, but Dale didn't get that for me. Band room is now occupied. Next 30 days, we need to finish the exterior finishes. We need to finish the","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14860-tx-1053-38","meetingDate":"2025-08-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 8/19/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14860","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14860","timestampSeconds":1053,"timestampLabel":"17:33","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- coiling grills at the cafeteria. We've still got some detailing to do, a print shop. We've got the flooring in at the cafeteria, except for the area where that's gonna be demoed as we demo the kitchen. We need to finish the finishes at choir, and then of course we've gotta do the kitchen mechanical and electrical.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":fals