y aye. Aye. Opposed? Motion carries. And now we'll look at revisions to the roles and responsibilities of the corporation administrative staff. Dr. Sanders.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3388-133","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3388,"timestampLabel":"56:28","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Yes, so sometimes the change is really hard. And we have a team approach here at Edgewood. And when you lose an all-star part of your team, it's really devastating at first because","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3418-134","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3418,"timestampLabel":"56:58","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- I really appreciated Matt Irwin and what he brought to our team. He was a good, great partner. And when that change happens at first, you're just really upset about it. But then you start to think about, well, how can we take this opportunity to make ourselves better?","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3443-135","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3443,"timestampLabel":"57:23","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- And 