ence":"unknown","text":"- on without missing a beat for the school corporation. We've made a lot of progress over the last several years, and we want to continue to march forward and keep that momentum going, not only for our students, but our staff also. And so being very transparent, what I did is I asked Matt to make a list of all the things that he does.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-354-15","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":354,"timestampLabel":"5:54","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- are prioritized in that study. We've had two demographic studies, the most recent one by McKibbin demographics in 2024. And then most recently, the board has met with teachers, administrators, athletic director, representatives from the performing arts, maintenance departments, skill and construction,","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3543-139","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3543,"timestampLabel":"59:03","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- or has done here in the school corporation. And I took every item on that list and assigned it to somebody in this office. I'm taking on more responsibilities. I'll have more direct responsibility for operations, transportation, food service, technology, maintenance,","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3574-140","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTit