ott's taking the lead on new teacher orientation and mentor teachers. I just saw the proposed agenda for that today.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5148-199","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5148,"timestampLabel":"1:25:48","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- We're looking at starting that around 10 o'clock or so on July 29th, keeping those brand new and one year teachers till about three o'clock that day. We have a full agenda for them just to introduce them to Edgewood, answer just basic questions. You know, first year teachers coming right out, no experience may have. And then the 30th will be a half day session where we'll have all of our teachers new to Edgewood joining those","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5176-200","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5176,"timestampLabel":"1:26:16","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- those first year teachers from the first day. Do you mind if we take a session on that Mr. DeMoss? I'll get you on the agenda. Well thank you very much and now we'll turn to RBBEA comments and we have Brandy Able with us here this evening.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5204-201","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5204,"timestampLabel":"1:26:44","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- three weeks, my daughter Paige, I know many of you remember her, has been texting me this whole time and for some reason she has my location on her phone and her last message was, you're starting with meetings already. So here we are.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5220-202","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5220,"timestampLabel":"1:27:00","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- I want to start by saying we do have another co-president. Hopefully you'll be meeting him soon. Stepped up at the 11th hour. Ty McGinnis, he'll be coming from the high school. And so I know that was Doug's hope to have somebody represent secondary and I'll be representing elementary. We met with Nancy a few weeks ago, had lunch with her, and since we're both newbies, it'll be nice. We're already making plans and hopefully can delegate more and just change","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5250-203","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5250,"timestampLabel":"1:27:30","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- change how the leadership has been since we're both brand new. And speaking of, I was going to say next week I would be reaching out but, Jennifer, I'll be reaching out maybe tomorrow to you and Megan because I know we always have that lunch for the new teachers so I'll get those numbers from you so I can start organizing that and know when to do that.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-527-22","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":527,"timestampLabel":"8:47","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- But I think the point is, working with Stiefel, Jerry, your goal is to make this kind of tax neutral for the taxpayers. What's that? That's at the 7%. That's at the max. I think that assumes a drop in net assessed value, and it assumes very conservative growth, if any at all. So yeah, they're trying to set you up to","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5273-204","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5273,"timestampLabel":"1:27:53","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- I just want to say, again, I appreciate Matt Irwin for everything he's done. And I was able to thank him personally for his service. And just again, he and Dr. Sanders, I've enjoyed working with both of you for the past couple of years with Association Matters. We've had hard conversations. And I just appreciate the communication and all the information and seeing through your eyes things that I don't see on my end. So anyway, just.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5303-205","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5303,"timestampLabel":"1:28:23","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- continued I look forward to continuing to work with you and bargaining and all that so that's all I have to say yeah thank you thank you now for board members we'll start with mr. boss tell page that your meetings are just starting and you will have more of them I am just so excited it there is such a","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5331-206","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5331,"timestampLabel":"1:28:51","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- a positive feel about where things are going. And I'm excited about the beginning of a new school year. It's hard to believe three weeks from tomorrow, kids will be in the classrooms, teachers will be ready to take them away. And I'm looking forward to it. I feel the same way. Thank you, sir. I'm so pleased and so happy for Jennifer and her crew that she'll be","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5356-207","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5356,"timestampLabel":"1:29:16","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- So we appreciate your your loyalty so much. We appreciate it. Thank you. I'm very excited about the new changes of contract in our administration team. You know it is nerve wracking is nerve wracking as a board when you have somebody step away and the capacity that Matt was in. However. I feel complete calm as as myself as a","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5386-208","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5386,"timestampLabel":"1:29:46","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- as a board member, I feel that this corporation is going to be in great hands. We have nothing to worry about. I know that everyone is going to be working very hard. You know, the next few years for us is going to be difficult. But with this team, I believe in all of us and that we're going to get through it. And it's going to continue to be a great school system. Mr. Director. Yeah, Ditto. I feel very much at comfort. I think we're in good shape.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5416-209","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5416,"timestampLabel":"1:30:16","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Thanks for helping us out again, Paul, for a little while. And yeah, looking forward to the school year. Three more weeks. Thank you. Yes, it comes fast. It's amazing how fast the summer goes. And it's hard to believe that we're in for another year. But it's exciting. I feel calm and confident that we're going to have a great year this year. And I always want to make sure all you out there","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5446-210","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5446,"timestampLabel":"1:30:46","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- very careful with the buses and things. It's always kind of rough the first couple of weeks or at least a few days. So please be patient and we would appreciate that and safety is number one. So I appreciate everyone coming tonight. I'm so glad that we're in the position we are and we've got the team we do. I think it's a successful team.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5474-211","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5474,"timestampLabel":"1:31:14","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- So with that, this meeting is adjourned and you all have a lovely evening.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-558-23","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":558,"timestampLabel":"9:18","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- show a worst case scenario. To note that this will be done over a series of bonds and as we plan the individual projects to be done. Okay, now I will open the hearing to public comment. Is t