4701","timestampSeconds":1609,"timestampLabel":"26:49","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- floor done in the cafeteria. We're definitely gonna get it painted before school. We're gonna get as far as we can with the floor. And Matt, I think Dale may have talked to you and Jerry. It may be something that you may be working off a concrete floor in there for some period of time as we go in the fall.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-1638-58","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":1638,"timestampLabel":"27:18","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- We'll do it in such a way that we can get in there and kind of give you part and work on part. And then the last thing we'll do is get into the existing kitchen and take it down. One change we made, excuse me, in the choir room, it had existing concrete risers. Those were originally called to be removed. After discussion with the high school staff, they decided they did not want them removed.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-166-6","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":166,"timestampLabel":"2:46","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- And it's exciting to see there's several on here for the new EECC, the expansion of that building. And so we're very excited to have those folks present tonight. We have some teachers who are present here tonight. And so I'm gonna call on the principals to introduce their new folks that are here. So let Brenda come up.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-1666-59","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":1666,"timestampLabel":"27:46","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- So that saved us a little time. So we're working on that and the band room, that whole area, phase eight of the high school is on schedule. So we expect that to be done by the time school starts. And then I'll just put that one little slide, the discus area off of the high school football stadium is in process right now.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-1695-60","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":1695,"timestampLabel":"28:15","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Again, don't expect to have good grass in there until at least spring and probably next fall, quite frankly. So at your leisure, you can kind of go through that. Primary school, a big push on the primary school. We did not want to do,","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-1722-61","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":1722,"timestampLabel":"28:42","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":