ampLabel":"47:54","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Would it be prudent to, if the 1028 would be by June 23rd to have the board at least vote that we agree to start with the $40 million and that we should use this timetable and authorize you to do the 1028 hearing? To publish the notice for the 1028 hearing, should the board go ahead and just authorize that?","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-29-1","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":29,"timestampLabel":"0:29","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Let the record reflect that all board members are present tonight. And are there any visitors? Are you a visitor? No, okay. My hearing aid just went out, so we'll see how this works. All right, we'll jump right into the consent agenda. We had a bunch of listening moments last week, not so long. We'll keep moving. We have the May 20th.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-2903-104","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":2903,"timestampLabel":"48:23","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- It's just. You can if you'd like, yeah, to kind of say, hey, please proceed with, you know, getting, you know, formulating projects and parameters and then we can kind of start the process, yeah. Okay. So the parameters, the budget would be the 40 million. That would be the 40 million and then Stiefel will run kind of not to exceed parameters for us. And t